  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oye, tú! Sí, pareces un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa muy fuerte.\n¡Mira qué Puerros más hermosos tengo hoy!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Conoces por casualidad a un Pokémon que se\nllama Farfetch’d?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0043006F006E006F00630065007300200070006F0072002000630061007300750061006C00690064006100640020006100200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007100750065002000730065000A006C006C0061006D006100200046006100720066006500740063006820190064003F00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre lleva consigo una hortaliza que blande\na veces como si fuera una espada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que corre un rumor inquietante sobre\nlos Puerros y los Farfetch’d.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicen que, si llevas un solo Farfetch’d de noche\na cierto lugar y lo equipas con un Puerro...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Unos tipos te atacan por sorpresa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y como pareces ser muy fuerte, quiero que\nvayas allí y les des una lección.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nToma, aquí tienes un Puerro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para encontrarte con esos bribones, tienes que ir\nde <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>noche<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> al <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>sector 7 del Distrito Rojo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> con <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>un solo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Farfetch’d<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> que lleve equipado un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Puerro<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 34,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recuerda los detalles de la misión:<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPara encontrarte con esos bribones, tienes que ir\nde <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>noche<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> al <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>sector 7 del Distrito Rojo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> con <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>un solo<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Farfetch’d<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> que lleve equipado un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Puerro<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 34,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 224
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hete aquí Puerro en mano a mitad de la noche.\n¡Esto clama a un duelo entre Farfetch’d!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, bueno, ¡¿y ese Puerro enorme?! ¿Acaso es\nun Farfetch’d de Galar?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006200750065006E006F002C002000A100BF00790020006500730065002000500075006500720072006F00200065006E006F0072006D0065003F0021002000BF0041006300610073006F002000650073000A0075006E00200046006100720066006500740063006820190064002000640065002000470061006C00610072003F00100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Feeetch!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600650065006500740063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡En guardia! ¡Por el Puerro!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006E002000670075006100720064006900610021002000A10050006F007200200065006C002000500075006500720072006F002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por cierto...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0072002000630069006500720074006F002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Al final eras más hábil de lo que parecías!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041006C002000660069006E0061006C002000650072006100730020006D00E100730020006800E100620069006C0020006400650020006C006F002000710075006500200070006100720065006300ED00610073002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has afrontado mi emboscada sin perder el temple\ny blandiendo el Puerro con maestría. Se nota<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque no eres un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa común y corriente.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te encomiendo por tu victoria contra él.\nDemostraste una habilidad asombrosa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero ahora tendrás que ponerla a prueba contra\ntodos mis años de experiencia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La derrota de mi compañero la siento como mía,\npor lo que me veo obligado a defender mi honor.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Puerro qué ven mis ojos?! ¿Un Farfetch’d de\nGalar? En fin, no me queda más remedio...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Feeetch!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600650065006500740063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Que gane el mejor! ¡Por el Puerro!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005100750065002000670061006E006500200065006C0020006D0065006A006F00720021002000A10050006F007200200065006C002000500075006500720072006F002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me rindo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0065002000720069006E0064006F002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué fuerza tan descomunal... Me pregunto\ncuánto habrás entrenado para llegar a ese nivel.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que lograste derrotarlos a ambos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED00200071007500650020006C006F00670072006100730074006500200064006500720072006F007400610072006C006F00730020006100200061006D0062006F0073002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué deshonra para los Tres Espuerrochines...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500E900200064006500730068006F006E00720061002000700061007200610020006C006F00730020005400720065007300200045007300700075006500720072006F006300680069006E00650073002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En realidad, yo soy Marcio, el tercer integrante\ndel grupo. El más fuerte de los tres, de hecho.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te mostraré la técnica de un Farfetch’d de Kanto!\n¡Prepárate a temblar de \"puerror\"!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me importa un cebollín que lleves un Farfetch’d\nde Galar!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTe voy a enseñar cómo se combate en Kanto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000720065007000E10072006100740065002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Feeetch!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600650065006500740063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por el Puerro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F007200200065006C002000500075006500720072006F002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Impresionante!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10049006D00700072006500730069006F006E0061006E00740065002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar, far, far!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460061006100610072002C0020006600610072002C002000660061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je, je, je...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002C0020006A0065002C0020006A0065002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Fue un combate maravilloso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460075006500200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400650020006D00610072006100760069006C006C006F0073006F002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Disculpa, pero es que nosotros tres somos fans\nde \"Los Tres Espuerrochines\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre fue nuestro sueño tener un combate\nPokémon recreándolo como en la película.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no encontrábamos Entrenadores con un\nFarfetch’d digno de enfrentarse a nosotros.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hasta que apareciste tú! Y te dirigiste a ese\ncallejón sin pensarlo dos veces.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te dimos más detalles para dotar de realismo\na la situación y que se palpara en el ambiente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lamento mucho haberte engañado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061006D0065006E0074006F0020006D007500630068006F0020006800610062006500720074006500200065006E0067006100F100610064006F002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sea como sea, ¡te agradezco en el alma que nos\nhayas ayudado a hacer realidad nuestro sueño!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por fin pude recrear la emoción de\nla película!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0072002000660069006E00200070007500640065002000720065006300720065006100720020006C006100200065006D006F0063006900F3006E002000640065000A006C0061002000700065006C00ED00630075006C0061002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y nuestros Farfetch’d también estuvieron a la\naltura. ¡Fue todo un espectáculo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Faaar, far, far!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460061006100610072002C0020006600610072002C002000660061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
